# WP3.3 D029 full-app host gesture fixture.
# Button ids: OCT-=0 OCT+=1 SEQ=11 PLAY=12.
# Encoder ids: KNOB1=2 KNOB2=3 KNOB3=4 KNOB4=5.
# Note masks are physical FM-1 key bits.

# Stale encoder movement before the hold must be drained/discarded.
50 enc 2 -20

# Enter ordinary SEQ, choose logical track 2 with black key index 3, then page 2.
100 btn 11
200 keys 8
210 keys 0
300 btn 1

# Hold white key index 4 = local step 3 / global step 19 UI. Same-poll delta must be discarded.
400 keys 16
400 enc 2 -7

# First eligible later-poll delta: VOICE LEVEL reference 255 -> 254.
500 enc 2 -1

# While held, black track key and OCT+ must not move the snapshotted target/cursor.
600 keys 48
650 btn 1

# PLAY may toggle while the p-lock hold remains active.
700 btn 12

# The first automatic screenshot at 1000 ms should still show T2 / PG2 / CUR19
# with K1 VOICE 254 LOCK in the footer.

# Release and a same-poll encoder movement: release wins and the -10 is discarded.
1100 keys 0
1100 enc 2 -10

# After release ordinary track/page navigation works again. Move away and back.
1150 keys 32
1160 keys 0
1200 keys 8
1210 keys 0
1250 btn 1
1300 btn 0

# Re-hold the same target. Same-poll +20 is discarded, then +1 replaces 254 -> 255.
1600 keys 16
1600 enc 2 20
1700 enc 2 1

# Suppression remains active during this second hold too.
1800 keys 48
1850 btn 1
1900 btn 12

# The automatic screenshot at 3000 ms should show the same target with
# K1 VOICE 255 LOCK, proving release-poll and begin-poll deltas did not leak.
3100 keys 0
3300 end
